  "prefLabel": "Site 204.02 Manner for Adoption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 204.02 Manner for Adoption.\n\n(a) The committee shall commence a rulemaking proceeding by drafting a proposed rule or by accepting as a proposed rule the draft of a rule proposed by any person.\n\n(b) With respect to any proposed rule, the committee shall conduct rulemaking and adoption proceedings pursuant to RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. #9183-A, eff 6-17-08; ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/site100-300.html"
